<title>USA: W.H. Brady acquires French marketer.</title>
<headline>W.H. Brady acquires French marketer.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.H. Brady Co said Wednesday it acquired Signals SA for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Signals, with revenues of about $7 million, markets safety and facility identification products including safety signs, asset-identification labels and personal protection equipment such as safety glasses, gloves, shields, fire extinguishers, first aid and ergonomic products, W.H. Brady said.</p>
<p>Brady shares were down 1/8 at 24-1/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
